  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>About our brand and products: </strong>Būma is a functional instant coffee brand built for people who need to be ON. Students, founders, developers, and anyone who thrives in deep work. Each serving blends premium instant coffee with L-theanine, an amino acid from green tea that takes the edge off caffeine and replaces the jittery crash with calm, sustained focus.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>What makes us different: </strong>Most coffee wires you up and burns you out. Būma is engineered to keep you sharp without the anxiety or the crash. We combine the convenience of instant coffee with the cognitive benefits of L-theanine, a stack used by high performers for years, now in a single scoop. No blending. No measuring. Just focus. We also care deeply about mental health. Anxiety, burnout, and caffeine-induced stress are real, and we built Būma specifically to take those off the table. Calm focus isn't just a tagline; it's the whole point.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>How affiliates can earn: </strong>Earn a commission on every sale you drive through your unique affiliate link. We offer competitive rates, real-time tracking, and timely payouts. The more you promote, the more you earn, with no cap on your commissions.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>How to promote us: </strong>Būma is built for content. Share your honest experience on TikTok, Instagram, YouTube, or your newsletter. Before-and-after focus sessions, study routines, morning stack videos, our audience responds to real, authentic content. We'll provide assets and discount codes for your followers to get you started.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>Other information: </strong>We're a small, founder-led brand that takes our affiliates seriously. You'll get direct access to our team, fast responses, and free samples so you can experience the product firsthand. We're looking for partners who believe in what we're building, not just another link to post.</p></div>",
